Title:  For that bit of plastic you would sell your soul

Seq:    5.7.54.2.5

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Starr, Ringo|Ringo Starr]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Beatles Anthology (Ringo)|The Beatles Anthology]]*

Body:

…but they were adamant, thank God, about not wanting this song they’d been given. On reflection, this was a huge stance because, as I say, for that bit of plastic you would sell your soul.

